   6:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *          functionalities of the Timer Extended peripheral:
   8:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Time Hall Sensor Interface Initialization
