  12:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Time Output Compare/PWM Channel Configuration (for channels 5 and 6)
  13:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Timer remapping capabilities configuration
  14:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Timer encoder index configuration
  15:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   ******************************************************************************
