  26:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   @verbatim
  27:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  28:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****                       ##### TIMER Extended features #####
  29:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  30:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   [..]
  31:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     The Timer Extended features include:
  32:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     (#) Complementary outputs with programmable dead-time for :
  33:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****         (++) Output Compare
  34:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****         (++) PWM generation (Edge and Center-aligned Mode)
  35:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****         (++) One-pulse mode output
  36:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     (#) Synchronization circuit to control the timer with external signals and to
  37:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****         interconnect several timers together.
  38:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     (#) Break input to put the timer output signals in reset state or in a known state.
  39:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     (#) Supports incremental (quadrature) encoder and hall-sensor circuitry for
  40:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****         positioning purposes
  41:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     (#) In case of Pulse on compare, configure pulse length and delay
  42:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     (#) Encoder index configuration
  43:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** 
  44:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****             ##### How to use this driver #####
  45:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  46:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     [..]
  47:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****      (#) Initialize the TIM low level resources by implementing the following functions
  48:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****          depending on the selected feature:
  49:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****            (++) Hall Sensor output : HAL_TIMEx_HallSensor_MspInit()
  50:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** 
  51:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****      (#) Initialize the TIM low level resources :
  52:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****         (##) Enable the TIM interface clock using __HAL_RCC_TIMx_CLK_ENABLE();
  53:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****         (##) TIM pins configuration
  54:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****             (+++) Enable the clock for the TIM GPIOs using the following function:
  55:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****               __HAL_RCC_GPIOx_CLK_ENABLE();
  56:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****             (+++) Configure these TIM pins in Alternate function mode using HAL_GPIO_Init();
  57:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** 
  58:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****      (#) The external Clock can be configured, if needed (the default clock is the
  59:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****          internal clock from the APBx), using the following function:
  60:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****          HAL_TIM_ConfigClockSource, the clock configuration should be done before
  61:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****          any start function.
  62:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** 
  63:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****      (#) Configure the TIM in the desired functioning mode using one of the
  64:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****          initialization function of this driver:
  65:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****           (++) HAL_TIMEx_HallSensor_Init() and HAL_TIMEx_ConfigCommutEvent(): to use the
  66:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****                Timer Hall Sensor Interface and the commutation event with the corresponding
  67:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****                Interrupt and DMA request if needed (Note that One Timer is used to interface
  68:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****                with the Hall sensor Interface and another Timer should be used to use
  69:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****                the commutation event).
  70:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****      (#) In case of Pulse On Compare:
  71:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****            (++) HAL_TIMEx_OC_ConfigPulseOnCompare(): to configure pulse width and prescaler
  72:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** 
  73:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** 
  74:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****      (#) Activate the TIM peripheral using one of the start functions:
  75:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****            (++) Complementary Output Compare : HAL_TIMEx_OCN_Start(), HAL_TIMEx_OCN_Start_DMA(),
  76:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****                 HAL_TIMEx_OCN_Start_IT()
  77:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****            (++) Complementary PWM generation : HAL_TIMEx_PWMN_Start(), HAL_TIMEx_PWMN_Start_DMA(),
  78:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****                 HAL_TIMEx_PWMN_Start_IT()
  79:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****            (++) Complementary One-pulse mode output : HAL_TIMEx_OnePulseN_Start(), HAL_TIMEx_OnePul
  80:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****            (++) Hall Sensor output : HAL_TIMEx_HallSensor_Start(), HAL_TIMEx_HallSensor_Start_DMA()
  81:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****                 HAL_TIMEx_HallSensor_Start_IT().
  82:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** 
