 126:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** /** @defgroup TIMEx_Exported_Functions_Group1 Extended Timer Hall Sensor functions
 127:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @brief    Timer Hall Sensor functions
 128:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *
 129:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** @verbatim
 130:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
 131:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****                       ##### Timer Hall Sensor functions #####
 132:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
 133:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   [..]
 134:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     This section provides functions allowing to:
 135:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     (+) Initialize and configure TIM HAL Sensor.
